ction, Paris, 2026. \u00a9 Tadao Ando Architect \u0026amp; Associates, Niney et Marca Architectes, agence Pierre-Antoine Gatier. Courtesy of the artist, Spr\u00fcth Magers and David Zwirner. Photo: Florent Michel.\u0022 \/\u003E\n\n\u003C\/a\u003E\n\u003C\/div\u003E\n      \n\u003C\/a\u003E\n      \u003C\/div\u003E\n      \n\n            \u003Cdiv class=\u0022field format-basic-html field-chapo\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPinault Collection pr\u00e9sente dans la Rotonde et les vingt-quatre vitrines de la Bourse de Commerce une exposition de l\u0027artiste am\u00e9ricaine Barbara Kruger, \u00ab\u0026nbsp;The History of Tears\u0026nbsp;\u00bb.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n      \n\n\n      \u003Cdiv class=\u0022links\u0022\u003E\n                  \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/billetterie.pinaultcollection.com\/selection\/timeslotpass?productId=10229955490476\u0026amp;gtmStepTracking=true\u0022 class=\u0022buy-ticket\u0022\u003EAcheter un billet\u003C\/a\u003E\n        \n        \n              \u003C\/div\u003E\n\n\n    \u003C\/div\u003E\n\n    \u003Cdiv class=\u0022main-image desktop-only\u0022\u003E\n      \n\n            \u003Cdiv class=\u0022field field-main-img\u0022\u003E\n  \u003Ca href=\u0022\/fr\/boursedecommerce\/history-tears\u0022 hreflang=\u0022fr\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 src=\u0022\/www.pinaultcollection.com\/p\/styles\/card\/public\/expo\/main\/bdc_remember_me-1-c-11h45-bd-2.jpg.webp?VersionId=1792077017.296317\u0026amp;itok=k5kE46Rx\u0022 width=\u00221649\u0022 height=\u00221100\u0022 alt=\u0022View of the exhibition \u201cThe History of Tears\u201d of Barbara Kruger, Bourse de Commerce \u2013 Pinault Collection, Paris, 2026. \u00a9 Tadao Ando Architect \u0026amp; Associates, Niney et Marca Architectes, agence Pierre-Antoine Gatier. Courtesy of the artist, Spr\u00fcth Magers and David Zwirner. Photo: Florent Michel.\u0022 title=\u0022View of the exhibition \u201cThe History of Tears\u201d of Barbara Kruger, Bourse de Commerce \u2013 Pinault Collection, Paris, 2026. \u00a9 Tadao Ando Architect \u0026amp; Associates, Niney et Marca Architectes, agence Pierre-Antoine Gatier. Courtesy of the artist, Spr\u00fcth Magers and David Zwirner. Photo: Florent Michel.\u0022 \/\u003E\n\n\u003C\/a\u003E\n\u003C\/div\u003E\n      \n\n    \u003C\/div\u003E\n\n  \u003C\/div\u003E\n\u003C\/article\u003E\n\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Carticle class=\u0022node is-expo as-agenda\u0022\u003E\n  \u003Cdiv class=\u0022cols\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv class=\u0022main-infos\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cdiv class=\u0022schedules\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cdiv class=\u0022dates\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dates\u0022\u003Ejusqu\u2019au 10 janvier 2027\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n        \u003Cdiv class=\u0022type\u0022\u003E\n          Exposition\n        \u003C\/div\u003E\n      \u003C\/div\u003E\n      \u003Ca href=\u0022\/fr\/boursedecommerce\/le-monde-selon-penn\u0022 rel=\u0022bookmark\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Ch2 class=\u0022expo-title\u0022\u003E\n          Le monde selon Penn \u003C\/a\u003E\n        \u003C\/h2\u003E\n      \u003C\/a\u003E\n      \u003Cdiv class=\u0022main-image mobile-only\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Ca href=\u0022\/fr\/boursedecommerce\/le-monde-selon-penn\u0022 rel=\u0022bookmark\u0022\u003E\n\n            \u003Cdiv class=\u0022field field-main-img\u0022\u003E\n  \u003Ca href=\u0022\/fr\/boursedecommerce\/le-monde-selon-penn\u0022 hreflang=\u0022fr\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 src=\u0022\/www.pinaultcollection.com\/p\/styles\/card\/public\/expo\/main\/514431-194215.jpg.webp?VersionId=1791807741.920694\u0026amp;itok=Eo6hIkzY\u0022 width=\u00221575\u0022 height=\u00221100\u0022 alt=\u0022Irving Penn, Gerbera Daisy, 2006 \u00a9 Irving Penn, Cond\u00e9 Nast Pinault Collection\u0022 title=\u0022Irving Penn, Gerbera Daisy, 2006 \u00a9 Irving Penn, Cond\u00e9 Nast Pinault Collection\u0022 \/\u003E\n\n\u003C\/a\u003E\n\u003C\/div\u003E\n      \n\u003C\/a\u003E\n      \u