iv class=\u0022type\u0022\u003E\n          Exposition\n        \u003C\/div\u003E\n      \u003C\/div\u003E\n      \u003Ca href=\u0022\/fr\/boursedecommerce\/raymond-depardon\u0022 rel=\u0022bookmark\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Ch2 class=\u0022expo-title\u0022\u003E\n          Raymond Depardon \u003C\/a\u003E\n        \u003C\/h2\u003E\n      \u003C\/a\u003E\n      \u003Cdiv class=\u0022main-image mobile-only\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Ca href=\u0022\/fr\/boursedecommerce\/raymond-depardon\u0022 rel=\u0022bookmark\u0022\u003E\n\n            \u003Cdiv class=\u0022field field-main-img\u0022\u003E\n  \u003Ca href=\u0022\/fr\/boursedecommerce\/raymond-depardon\u0022 hreflang=\u0022fr\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 src=\u0022\/www.pinaultcollection.com\/p\/styles\/card\/public\/expo\/main\/raymond-depardon-cosne-cours-sur-loire-nievre-2009.jpg.webp?VersionId=1791877514.928584\u0026amp;itok=M6Jz_6AY\u0022 width=\u00221374\u0022 height=\u00221100\u0022 alt=\u0022Raymond Depardon, Cosne-Cours-sur-Loire, Ni\u00e8vre, 2009, Tirage argentico-num\u00e9rique couleur, 54 x 67,5 cm (sans cadre)\u0022 title=\u0022Raymond Depardon, Cosne-Cours-sur-Loire, Ni\u00e8vre, 2009, Tirage argentico-num\u00e9rique couleur, 54 x 67,5 cm (sans cadre) \u00a9 Raymond Depardon \/ Magnum Photos Pinault Collection\u0022 \/\u003E\n\n\u003C\/a\u003E\n\u003C\/div\u003E\n      \n\u003C\/a\u003E\n      \u003C\/div\u003E\n      \n\n            \u003Cdiv class=\u0022field format-basic-html field-chapo\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDans la Galerie 3, une cinquantaine de photographies de Raymond Depardon issues de la Collection Pinault mettent en lumi\u00e8re son travail consacr\u00e9 au paysage fran\u00e7ais.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n      \n\n\n      \u003Cdiv class=\u0022links\u0022\u003E\n                  \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/billetterie.pinaultcollection.com\/selection\/timeslotpass?productId=10229955490476\u0026amp;gtmStepTracking=true\u0022 class=\u0022buy-ticket\u0022\u003EAcheter