-goldin-stendhal-syndrome\u0022 rel=\u0022bookmark\u0022\u003E\n\n            \u003Cdiv class=\u0022field field-main-img\u0022\u003E\n  \u003Ca href=\u0022\/fr\/boursedecommerce\/nan-goldin-stendhal-syndrome\u0022 hreflang=\u0022fr\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 src=\u0022\/www.pinaultcollection.com\/p\/styles\/card\/public\/expo\/main\/_dsc4521-1.jpg.webp?VersionId=1792656022.595411\u0026amp;itok=jHydZuTL\u0022 width=\u00221013\u0022 height=\u00221100\u0022 alt=\u0022Nan Goldin, Stendhal Syndrome, 2024 Digital slideshow, 26 min. Courtesy of the artist  View of the exhibition \u201cRemember Me\u201d, Bourse de Commerce \u2013 Pinault Collection, Paris, 2026-2027. \u00a9 Tadao Ando Architect \u0026amp; Associates, Niney et Marca Architectes, agence Pierre-Antoine Gatier. Photo : Micka\u00ebl Llorca.\u0022 title=\u0022Nan Goldin, Stendhal Syndrome, 2024 Digital slideshow, 26 min. Courtesy of the artist  View of the exhibition \u201cRemember Me\u201d, Bourse de Commerce \u2013 Pinault Collection, Paris, 2026-2027. \u00a9 Tadao Ando Architect \u0026amp; Associates, Niney et Marca Architectes, agence Pierre-Antoine Gatier. Photo : Micka\u00ebl Llorca.\u0022 \/\u003E\n\n\u003C\/a\u003E\n\u003C\/div\u003E\n      \n\u003C\/a\u003E\n      \u003C\/div\u003E\n      \n\n            \u003Cdiv class=\u0022field format-basic-html field-chapo\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPr\u00e9sent\u00e9e dans l\u2019Auditorium du mus\u00e9e dans le cadre de l\u0027exposition \u00ab\u202f\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/www.pinaultcollection.com\/fr\/boursedecommerce\/remember-me\u0022\u003ERemember Me\u003C\/a\u003E\u202f\u00bb, cette \u0153uvre prend la forme d\u2019un dialogue visuel entre universalit\u00e9 et intimit\u00e9, et relit le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre syndrome de Stendhal, illustrant \u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n      \n\n\n      \u003Cdiv class=\u0022links\u0022\u003E\n                  \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/billetterie.pinaultcollection.com\/selection\/timeslotpass?produ